# Placeholder file to keep the models directory in git
# Model files (.pt) are tracked using Git LFS

# Expected model files:
# - best_model.pt: Best performing model during training
# - final_model.pt: Final model after all epochs
# - metrics.json: Training metrics

# To train a new model:
# python src/models/train.py --epochs 20 --batch_size 32

# To create a test model for CI/CD (without full training):
# python scripts/create_test_model.py
